flowchart LR

    Student[Student]
    Admin[Administrator]

    Auth((Login / Authentication))
    Browse((Browse Events))
    Register((Register Event))
    ManageEvents((Manage Events))
    ManageRegistrations((Manage Registrations))
    ManageReviews((Manage Reviews))

    Users[(User Database)]
    Events[(Event Database)]
    Registrations[(Registration Database)]
    Reviews[(Review Database)]

    Student -->|Login| Auth
    Auth --> Users
    Users --> Auth
    Auth --> Student

    Student -->|Browse Events| Browse
    Browse --> Events
    Events --> Browse
    Browse --> Student

    Student -->|Register Event| Register
    Register --> Events
    Register --> Registrations
    Registrations --> Register
    Register --> Student

    Admin -->|Manage Events| ManageEvents
    ManageEvents --> Events
    Events --> ManageEvents

    Admin -->|Manage Registrations| ManageRegistrations
    ManageRegistrations --> Registrations
    Registrations --> ManageRegistrations

    Admin -->|Manage Reviews| ManageReviews
    ManageReviews --> Reviews
    Reviews --> ManageReviews
